# MyEnv Clink Readline Configuration
# Universal Key Map for Ctrl+Space -> F7 Boxed History Popup Menu

# 1. All representations of Ctrl+Space bound to clink-popup-history (Exact F7 Boxed Menu)
"\C-@": clink-popup-history
"C-@": clink-popup-history
"\C- ": clink-popup-history
"C-Space": clink-popup-history
"Control-space": clink-popup-history
"Control-@": clink-popup-history
"\e[32;5u": clink-popup-history

# 2. F7 key
"F7": clink-popup-history
"\e[18~": clink-popup-history

# 3. Tab Key -> File, Directory & Path Completion Menu
"\t": clink-completion-popup
"Tab": clink-completion-popup

# 4. Standard Text Editing & Cursor Movement (Character-by-character text editing)
# Left (←) and Right (→) arrows move character-by-character natively
